Dialogue: Marked=0,0:56:14.57,0:56:16.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:56:22.31,0:56:24.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,舒服吗？ 好舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:56:32.58,0:56:34.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:57:01.55,0:57:03.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太舒服了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:57:10.09,0:57:12.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以舒服起来吗？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:57:14.49,0:57:16.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以射吗？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:57:17.03,0:57:21.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要射这里 可以帮我撸吗？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:57:55.20,0:57:57.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以吗？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:58:07.75,0:58:09.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准备帮我撸
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:58:19.89,0:58:21.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太舒服了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:58:29.90,0:58:31.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好湿
